WEBVTT

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.890
Calm yourself, Fowler.

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:07.650
Luze.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.480
Good to see you again, Luka.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.870
Or should I call you "brother"?

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:20.420
Luka, is this man...

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:24.120
Yes, he is my younger twin brother.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.440
What shall we do, Fowler?

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.180
Destroy all who stand in our way.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.140
Understood.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:38.010
Prepare yourself, Luka Crosszeria.

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:49.590
In the thousand years since that day
known as the Setting of Taurus,

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:53.150
sadness and rage have been
endlessly passed down.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:56.820
These emotions have bred new hatred.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:04.900
And the hellfire of anger
consumes all blindly.

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:11.350
And I don't have the power to
stop this terrible cycle...

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:18.640
Only I know your pain...

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:20.720
Your uncertainty...

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:23.940
Your loneliness...

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:29.140
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:35.660
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:45.880
I will not betray you!

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:30.060
Where is everyone?

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:34.110
They have departed along
the path you indicated.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:36.830
Now that I think about it,

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:41.400
the closeness between a male Yuki
and Wakamiya Kanata

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.870
is an irregularity the prophecy
did not predict.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:51.420
As head of the Giou Clan,
I must see this to its end.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:03:59.920
You...

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:01.920
Are you going?

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:02.930
Yes.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.410
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:07.030
Be careful.

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:10.600
Takashiro-sama, please take care of Yuki.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.110
Please...

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:15.300
I understand.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:28.570
Connected Hearts

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.090
Why did you abandon the status
you finally achieved

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:36.090
to side with the humans?

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:39.330
I do not regret my decision.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.010
That's not what I'm asking.

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:52.040
Doesn't our family's humiliation,

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.810
after your betrayal, disturb you at all?

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.180
Luka.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.210
Another one of your crimes.

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:00.780
What?

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.660
Light will always cast shadows.

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:09.660
Even if you forget, you will
always find each other.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:13.420
And the purer your feelings,
the greater the darkness.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:15.000
I create darkness?

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.250
That is why I wanted you.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:23.300
What is this?

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.260
You're here, Takashiro.

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:46.820
The power of darkness?

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.620
Yes, Takashiro probably intends to use the

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:52.660
power of the darkness within himself.

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.040
Isn't that...

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:58.650
Not even I know what will happen.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:03.170
What is this power?

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:08.220
I fell to your level long ago.

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:14.560
<i>I carry a Duras within my body.</i>

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:16.450
Takashiro-san.

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:20.320
I'll stop you!

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:24.200
You again!

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:34.120
Are you that desperate to
defeat me, Takashiro?

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.650
It's been a thousand years.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:40.590
It's time for you to experience
these burning emotions.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:46.050
I will bury your words and
your life in oblivion!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.060
<i>I can't believe you two are having
private conversations again.</i>

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:03.690
<i>Men always create
their own worlds.</i>

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:11.740
<i>You two must be close,
Takashiro and Reiga.</i>

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:22.840
<i>Another one of your crimes.</i>

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:28.840
<i>The purer your feelings,
the greater the darkness.</i>

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.220
What should I do?

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:37.260
What should I do to stop this terrible cycle?

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:42.860
What can I do now?

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:46.820
Hey, when will Yuki-kun come home?

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:49.630
I'm not sure.

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:50.370
What?

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:54.130
Did he forget about us?

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:55.660
Of course not.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:57.960
Yuki-kun's really kind.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:07:59.080
You think so?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.190
I'm certain. It'll be all right.

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:06.180
Yuki-kun, everyone is waiting
for you to come home.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.500
Is this the Halo Wall?

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:14.590
Get back, Luze!

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:15.230
What?

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:17.400
His power will be unleashed.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:21.260
When God's Light runs beyond control,
darkness is dispelled.

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:24.010
A Duras's very existence would
suffer serious damage.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:36.830
This is...

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:40.500
God's Light?

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.780
Shusei, where's Yuki?

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:51.260
I can't see, with this bright light.

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:57.470
That idiot, worrying about others
at a time like this...

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:01.590
That was a close call.

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:04.560
It seems Hyde didn't get away in time.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:08.030
His life was never important.
Worry not about it.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.700
Where is Reiga-sama?

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:14.930
I doubt that could kill that
human-blooded, irresolute man.

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:16.870
What should we do now?

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:21.380
I was simply ordered to handle the Zweilts.

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:26.960
Besides, it would be tasteless to
interrupt their emotional reunion.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:31.090
I can't say I don't like this side of you.

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:35.550
Brother.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:50.920
If I cannot erase the sadness and hate,

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:56.130
I, at least, want to protect those
who gave me a reason to live.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:09:59.530
Yuki!

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.170
Luka. Stay back!

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:07.170
I can't stop it!

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:09.040
I can't stop it anymore!

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:13.880
It's all right. Wait there.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:15.930
Luka...

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:20.780
How is he, a Duras, still alive inside?

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:25.390
Luka is protected by his contract with Yuki.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:32.260
No... Contracts never held
any meaning to those two.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:39.200
Isn't this the truth you were searching for?

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.770
Thank you, Luka.

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.370
Yuki...

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:34.090
Hotsuma, we shouldn't.

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:43.410
Why can't I see Yuki?

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:46.080
We should leave them alone for now.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:47.380
What?

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:49.240
Come on. I'll give you some sweets.

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:54.440
Yuki.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:55.760
Luka.

00:11:57.680 --> 00:12:00.460
I'm glad you're okay.

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.200
Thanks to you.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.120
Is everyone else?

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:03.640
Yes.

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:05.660
Good.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:09.840
I managed to do something useful.

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:11.720
It's fine now.

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:12.400
What?

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:15.330
Luka...

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:19.910
What need is there for
you to suffer like this?

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:27.080
<i>Luka, please be there
for me at the end.</i>

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:34.050
<i>If I am destined to die,
I want you to be the one who frees me.</i>

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:37.590
<i>Be the one to kill me.</i>

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:40.310
I...

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.390
I will end this.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:49.520
I want you and the others to be free.

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:53.150
If I refuse to face reality,
nothing will change.

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:56.850
That's why I won't run anymore,

00:12:56.850 --> 00:13:00.530
even if I must face Kanata-san.

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:03.540
The true God's Light?

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.340
He does not just heal wounds.

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:11.610
His white heart makes people
realize their mistakes,

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:13.820
and supports them.

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:17.160
That is why it is known as God's Light.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:20.600
Is that why you've risked sending
Yuki to the Twilight Mansion?

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:23.810
Because you thought it would
help the Zweilts?

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:26.560
I don't know.

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:32.910
In truth, we may be the ones
who wished to be healed.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.450
<i>Kanata-san, I have an idea.</i>

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:44.100
<i>People may betray each other.</i>

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:51.000
<i>But once connected, hearts
can never be separated.</i>

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.310
<i>That is what I believe now.</i>

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:05.440
You're saying the prophetic ritual
did not predict an emergency?

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:06.100
Yes.

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:09.830
Then can we assume we will
have no significant battles

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.690
with Reiga in the near future?

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:16.370
We cannot let down our guard completely,

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.400
but it's better than being completely blind.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:22.180
I am curious about this other objective

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:23.720
Reiga is supposed to have.

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:27.370
Isn't his goal to capture Yuki?

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:30.610
That must not be everything.

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:34.550
We will keep you informed as necessary.

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:35.710
Fuyutoki.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:36.660
Yes, sir.

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:38.530
Give them this message.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:46.270
Tell them to do as they wish,
until the next battle begins.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.330
Very well.

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:55.660
Huh? Shusei, are you leaving already?

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:57.230
Yes.

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:58.920
Too bad.

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:03.050
I was hoping to bathe together.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:07.120
Hey! Eating all that cold stuff at once

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:08.120
will give you a stomachache.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.050
I'm glad.

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:17.790
You never scold people who
don't matter to you.

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:22.420
Have I been worrying you that much?

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:24.830
I'm fine now.

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:29.570
When I was younger,
even eating was just a chore.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:31.620
But I'm starting to enjoy it.

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:34.970
Toko-chan told me something.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:39.400
She said eating with people you're
comfortable with is fun.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:44.640
I guess that means we've gotten
used to you, Shusei.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:47.410
Tsukumo...

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.200
Eat this.

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:53.080
And from now on, pay
more attention to me.

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:07.270
Why'd you turn it off?

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.760
Oh, you're awake?

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:11.100
Can't you tell?

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:13.080
As far as I could tell, you passed out

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:14.640
from playing games too much.

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:18.080
Why, you... Are you trying to start a fight?

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.250
Hey, is that...

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.290
Master, master, master!

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:27.620
You're an idiot! Who'd want
to spend time with you?

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.870
Did you just call me an idiot?

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.530
Yeah? So what if I did?

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.500
Okay, let's settle this, once and for all.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:35.210
I couldn't have said it better myself!

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:36.830
Bring it on, you little monkey.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:50.430
I heard Kuroto is transferring
to our high school.

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:52.140
Yes, that's what I've heard.

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:54.930
Senshiro-san, what are you going to do?

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:59.300
I'm thinking of returning to college,
to continue studying art.

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:03.570
Would you show me your work some time?

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.570
I'd be happy to.

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:06.410
Toko-chan.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:08.380
Tsukumo...

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.810
I'll give you these, so please
stop chasing Toko-chan.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:12.410
What?

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.740
Tsukumo, what are you talking about?

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:15.870
But Toko-chan...

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.420
There you go again.
Lying on my bed like it's yours...

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:24.750
Can't you play games in your own room?

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:28.110
You're eating ice cream? Give me some!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:30.450
Tsukumo gave this to me.

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:32.690
Just one bite! One bite!

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:33.850
What are you? A kid?

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:34.870
Here.

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:37.610
It's good.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:43.150
I heard the basketball club asked you
to play in the upcoming game.

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:45.230
Hey.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.780
Didn't you say just one bite?

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:48.950
You noticed?

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:50.870
It's fine. You can eat all of it.

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:51.940
Really?

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:59.960
To be honest, I'm still a little scared.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:00.510
Huh?

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:04.730
I had stopped being afraid of God's Voice.

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:08.750
But now, I'm not sure I have
full control over it.

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:10.190
Hotsuma...

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:15.290
I figured I can't hurt anyone,
if I stay away from them.

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:21.830
If not for you, I might have
been alone my whole life.

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:28.370
I'm glad I have you.

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:32.060
Thanks, Shusei.

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:40.050
These scars always reminded
me of my guilt,

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:43.790
but they're also proof you risked
your life to protect me.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:49.090
When I think of them that way,
I'm almost proud of them.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.080
I see.

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:56.600
It's harder for you to feel that way, though.

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:57.260
Huh?

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:58.720
Either way, it hurt.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.850
And I can't wear tank tops in the summer.

00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:02.540
Listen, Shusei...

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.680
I didn't mean I'm proud of them.

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:06.590
I just wanted to say I care about you!

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:08.650
I haven't forgotten, or anything like that!

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:10.570
I-I'll take full responsibility!

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:15.240
Win

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:20.830
Is that all you can come up with?

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:22.510
Shusei...

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.500
You're so easy to fool.

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:25.930
You won't get away with this!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.750
Hotsuma, the ice cream!

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:33.760
No!

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:35.350
Why are you running?

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:38.310
If you drink this, you'll gain powers, too!

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:40.180
What kind of powers?

00:19:40.260 --> 00:19:41.890
I call it God's Tongue!
God's Tongue

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:43.480
Is that...

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:46.400
It's the power to make anything
you eat taste delicious.

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:48.180
I'm going back home!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:50.130
This is what you call peace.

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:54.260
Boss, what are you up to today?

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:59.100
Isuzu told me to come for
my regular checkup.

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:00.380
No!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.870
Stop it!

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:07.190
Yuki was supposed to be here, too.
I guess I'll come back later.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:11.980
Yuki-san went into the forest
with Luka-sama.

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:18.220
Sorry. It's been a while since
I've been out of the house.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:28.480
Luka, I had a thought during that battle.

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:34.460
I want to be able to protect myself,
you, and the others eventually.

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:41.330
Because you're all so important to me,
I want to do it with my own strength.

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:46.620
Luka?

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.930
Once again, I swear to you...

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:07.330
My life will be your shield,
and my body will be your sword.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:11.210
Until the day I die, I promise I will...

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:13.160
Will you promise me one thing?

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:20.890
If we manage to end all of this,

00:21:21.810 --> 00:21:24.190
promise me you'll come back here.

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:29.730
Please don't give up on your own happiness.

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:31.370
Yuki-chan!

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:48.110
Let's go, Luka.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:50.440
Yes.

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:57.120
Uncertainty, sadness, and pain...

00:21:57.780 --> 00:22:03.830
If we walk this path together,
I'm sure someday...
